<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 600 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', letterSpacing: 2 }}>02 · ABILITY LANDSCAPE</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.2 }}>
            答案带着出处：从一堆文档到一个可信答复
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E2E8F0', marginTop: 16 }} />

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 20 }}>
            {/* 七段链路 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>解析</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>PDF / DOCX / XLSX / HTML</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={20} height={14} viewBox='0 0 20 14'><path d='M0 7 L12 7' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M12 2 L20 7 L12 12 Z' fill='#C7D6F5' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>OCR</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>本地 rapidocr 或视觉模型</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={20} height={14} viewBox='0 0 20 14'><path d='M0 7 L12 7' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M12 2 L20 7 L12 12 Z' fill='#C7D6F5' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>分块</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>800 字符 / 重叠 120</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={20} height={14} viewBox='0 0 20 14'><path d='M0 7 L12 7' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M12 2 L20 7 L12 12 Z' fill='#C7D6F5' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>向量化</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>本地 ONNX 或远程端点</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={20} height={14} viewBox='0 0 20 14'><path d='M0 7 L12 7' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M12 2 L20 7 L12 12 Z' fill='#C7D6F5' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#E8EEFB', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#C7D6F5', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>索引</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>每库一份 SQLite</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={20} height={14} viewBox='0 0 20 14'><path d='M0 7 L12 7' stroke='#C7D6F5' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M12 2 L20 7 L12 12 Z' fill='#C7D6F5' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#D6E4F9', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>检索</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>Top-K 8 / 预算 6000 字</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 20, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <svg width={20} height={14} viewBox='0 0 20 14'><path d='M0 7 L12 7' stroke='#F59E0B' strokeWidth='2' /><path d='M12 2 L20 7 L12 12 Z' fill='#F59E0B' /></svg>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 142, background: '#FFF7E9', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#F5D9A4', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 8, padding: 11, alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: '600', color: '#B45309', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>引用溯源</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#92400E', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>答案附来源标记</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            {/* 三张证据卡 */}
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, marginTop: 22 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>中文场景做了专门处理</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        编码自动在 UTF-8 与 GB18030 之间回退，.doc / .wps / .xls 等格式走格式转换服务，扫描件自动回退到 OCR。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>Embedding 可以不出内网</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        默认使用本地 ONNX 模型生成向量；若追求效果，也可切到已配置供应商的兼容端点，由企业按数据敏感度自行选择。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderWidth: 1, borderColor: '#E2E8F0', borderStyle: 'solid', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>边界说在前面</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>
                        当前为向量余弦检索，未做关键词混合检索；中小企业语料规模下召回质量足够，超大规模场景我们再评估索引升级。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F4F6FB', borderRadius: 8, padding: 16, gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, borderRadius: 2, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 19, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                减少幻觉的关键不在于换个更大的模型，而在于让答案锚定企业自己的文档，并把出处一并交到使用者手上。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
